I re-enable Emulate Mouse from Touch, the signal then fires as expected. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMake Area2D with CollisionPolygon2D child node and connect \"input_event\". Disable Emulate Mouse from Touch in project settings, then build and deploy on iOS device. I've attached a small project below for convenience \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe InputEvent signal isn't being called at all on iOS or Android devices, even the print(\"event\") statement isn't called. \n\n[input-event-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21776245/input-event-test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109615/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}